{"3256610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bubble Balance Bonanza", "steam_appid": 3256610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4754190], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/b11da1471f3f7f4871ac6fb4d7900f6a.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.poster.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.webm?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.mp4?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bump, jump, and crash your way through many unique levels in this fast-paced, marble style, physics-driven platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/de07749a686210b2f673a1cce314fa6d.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/b2de3ac6ad19d1973899bd442766acdd.poster.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/b2de3ac6ad19d1973899bd442766acdd.webm?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/b2de3ac6ad19d1973899bd442766acdd.mp4?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protected by a bubble, you'll embark on a wild adventure through an unknown and treacherous world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lots of levels to explore and complete, you'll meet many other creatures, animals and friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/43fa46aadf30959d9bde06f6f1bf307b.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c910e64d1120982dfbc0c25735b6b3b8.poster.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c910e64d1120982dfbc0c25735b6b3b8.webm?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c910e64d1120982dfbc0c25735b6b3b8.mp4?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Y</i>ou are in control of a young and determined T-Rex who must venture into the wild unknown and recover the precious eggs of your unborn siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/66c43e4c187f554b3dc3314fbe1e1adc.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/68431b7020542c152ca8fb7b4ed61b14.poster.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/68431b7020542c152ca8fb7b4ed61b14.webm?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/68431b7020542c152ca8fb7b4ed61b14.mp4?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to master the physics of rolling, bouncing, and crashing as you overcome obstacles, avoid enemies, and solve puzzles to rescue the fragile eggs scattered across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/66d4fa155cd7257eefff0a3da3d6780d.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/b11da1471f3f7f4871ac6fb4d7900f6a.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1280 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.poster.avif?t=1779111120\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.webm?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256610/extras/c31faab6f4873b3a94831c624484fff4.mp4?t=1779111120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bump, jump, and cra